{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/854312-ideas-on-how-to-put-hunters-in-their-place-sadistic-evil-minds-wanted","id":854312,"title":"Ideas on how to Put hunters \"In their place\" Sadistic evil minds wanted.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-03-27T19:09:04-07:00","id":854312,"title":"Ideas on how to Put hunters \"In their place\" Sadistic evil minds wanted.","content":"Lets say your a vampire, or maybe a shadow lord Garou or unseelie sidhe, and meet some monster hunters, and are infuriated at the impertinence, of thse humans DARING to strike at their betters...<br /> <br /> A Red Talon, Get of Fenris, RedCap or Gangrel might just slaughter them, but if you want to enjoy emosadism, ideas on how to go about &quot;Putting them in their place&quot; <br /> <br /> Most blatant form of emosadism is hurting their family, to watch them wince in pain.and laugh.<br /> <br /> Next idea I have is to use Riddles, and Traps, to lead a hunter into a funhouse of death, so that you can laugh at how the hunters own stupidity killed him.<br /> <br /> Anymore ideas? <br /> <br /> Dominate... can obviously be used on those close to a hunter.<br /> <br /> Think Conditionings effects are impossible to disguise?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-27T21:21:21-07:00","id":854354,"title":"","content":"My kindred go simple when torturing particularly annoying mortals. You take their hands and tongue. They go for hands instead of feet because it's arguably more difficult to navigate the modern world without the ability to hold things, especially without a tongue since you can't use voice activated tech either. This is even more torturous to a hunter, because it basically eliminates their ability to ever hunt again or to pass on their knowledge (beyond of course anything previously written down), but they get to live knowing they can no longer fulfill their life mission at all, while knowing my kindred's probably going out to hunt right that moment.<br /> <br /> Alternatively, Dominate and ghoul them, then make them help you hunt for prey. But that runs the risk of shenanigans happening to free them to come after you later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-27T22:01:18-07:00","id":854360,"title":"","content":"How effective are they? If they are a joke then why are you wasting your time on this? IF they are an actual threat ... you have a tool in your hand to use against your enemies. Show how you are a &quot;Good&quot; guy explain the &quot;real story&quot;(mind control helps) then send them to fuck up various people you don't like!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T08:41:52-07:00","id":854496,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn valid options, another I just thought of.<br /> <br /> Does a <a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/JokerJury\" target=\"_blank\">http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/JokerJury</a> Seem like a workable plan if you want to gratify your ego...<br /> <br /> Or if your a garou sept or Kithain freehold that nearly got destroyed, giving a captured First Teamer or Autumn person a &quot;Trial&quot; Might be a fun way to entertain yourself.<br /> <br /> (And if your a Changeling, to generate Glamour) <br /> <br /> Now that would be FAIR in my opinion, but would SEEM like a Joker Jury to the person in question.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 03-28-2016, 05:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T21:48:38-07:00","id":854871,"title":"","content":"Well if you want just banal idiotic moustache-twirling evil just dominate/presence them into fighting each other with box cutters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-28T22:13:24-07:00","id":854880,"title":"","content":"Kindred: Embrace one (or all, if they are imune to blood binding as mortals) Then have the one embraced blood bind everyone else. Then torture that person, who everyone else is forced to love and care deeply for (a Tzimisce favourite). Or dominate them to torture eachother<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Just mundane rape and torture works, really, but each has it's own speciality.<br /> <br /> Madness- All of them. The ability to inflict madness works on a personal level to me. Always kill the malk first. <br /> Turning them into an animal- Mages, werewolves<br /> Enhancing their perception of pain- All of them. Less so werewolves, they just have powers that cause a lot of pain.<br /> sculpting their flesh- Vampires. Mages.<br /> Turning them into furniture- Vampires, Mages.<br /> Put them in an incomprehensible umbral realm of terror. Fae, Werewolves and mages. Lasombra vampires (but the abyss kills them after a short while, and it's a high level thing to send them there).<br /> Putting a weird restriction on them (IE never pee in the same sitting you poo in, or your inards will disolve) Fae, Werecreatures,mages (probably) some really powerful vampires","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7244-innocent-flower","name":"Innocent Flower","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7244_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"322"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-29T15:46:24-07:00","id":855296,"title":"","content":"Go after their families and loved ones. Show them that they aren't just putting themselves at risk, but everyone that they care about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1129-sergeant-brother","name":"Sergeant Brother","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1129_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-29T17:06:24-07:00","id":855353,"title":"","content":"any ideas to make sure it BREAKS as opposed to incenses them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-29T17:18:11-07:00","id":855360,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/854312-ideas-on-how-to-put-hunters-in-their-place-sadistic-evil-minds-wanted?p=855353#post855353\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">any ideas to make sure it BREAKS as opposed to incenses them?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well seeing how we are dealing with pretend people it's all up to the st and probably some will power rolls. <br /> <br /> There is no guaranteed way to break anyone use some common sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":